{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37714","headline":"宗人作尉唐昌官署幽胜而又博学精富得以言谈将欲他之留书屋壁 · 郑谷","name":"宗人作尉唐昌官署幽胜而又博学精富得以言谈将欲他之留书屋壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公堂潇洒有林泉，秪隔苔墙是渚田。\n宗党相亲离乱世，春秋闲论战争年。\n远江惊鹭来池口，绝顶归云过竹边。\n风雨夜长同一宿，旧游多共忆樊川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}